H16 â€“ H20
Capacity 1.6 t â€“ 2.0 t | Series 391
Agile bundle of energy
 â†’ Compact dimensions for operation in tight corners
 â†’  Spacious, ergonomic workplace with outstanding visibility for maximum  
 operating comfort
 â†’  Sturdy design for the most demanding applications in dusty environments  
or multi-shift operation
 â†’  Wide variety of models, comprehensive range of standard equipment, additional options 
and customer-specific solutions for maximum versatility
 â†’  Hydrostatic direct drive, twin pedal control and Linde Load Control ensure powerful,  
fast and precise power delivery
 â†’  Low fuel consumption, long service intervals and maintenance-free components  
ensure high availability and keep total cost of ownership as low as possible
